1
00:00:00,497 --> 00:00:02,837
(Leonard:)- I can't drive you for the next few weeks.
- No.

2
00:00:02,999 --> 00:00:06,169
(Sheldon:)You said you couldn't drive me to work.
This is from work.

3
00:00:07,170 --> 00:00:08,500
(Leonard:)Howard, help me out here.

4
00:00:09,005 --> 00:00:12,505
(Howard:)No, just for the fun of it,
I'm gonna take his side.

5
00:00:13,677 --> 00:00:15,597
(Sheldon:)Now, how do you propose I get home?

6
00:00:16,263 --> 00:00:19,103
- How did you get here in the first place?
- Penny.

7
00:00:19,266 --> 00:00:22,016
(Sheldon:)But I sense that's no longer an option.

8
00:00:23,145 --> 00:00:24,605
(Leonard:)Look, I need to get to the laser lab.

9
00:00:24,771 --> 00:00:28,441
You're just gonna have to find
someone else to take you home.

10
00:00:34,406 --> 00:00:37,366
(Howard:)Oh, damn. I picked the wrong side.

11
00:00:38,869 --> 00:00:40,999
[SCREAMING]

12
00:00:42,747 --> 00:00:45,377
(Sheldon:)Oh, God, not Euclid Avenue.

13
00:00:46,209 --> 00:00:48,749
[SCREAMING]

14
00:00:52,507 --> 00:00:55,637
(Raj:)Why did Howard leave you
in the middle of the road, anyway?

15
00:00:57,053 --> 00:00:58,553
(Sheldon:)We had a difference of opinion.

16
00:00:58,722 --> 00:01:00,222
(Raj:)Over what?

